@startuml

actor User as "Пользователь"
participant Browser as "Браузер (JS)"
participant "Web Crypto" as Crypto
participant "Spring Boot" as Server
participant "DB" as Database

User -> Browser: Вводит:\n- site\n- login\n- password
activate Browser

Browser -> Browser: Получить текущий vault из памяти
Browser -> Browser: Добавить новую запись

Browser -> Crypto: AES-256-GCM.encrypt(decryptionKey, обновленный vault)
activate Crypto
Crypto --> Browser: newEncryptedVault
deactivate Crypto

Browser -> Server: PUT /api/vault (with JWT)\n{encryptedVault: newEncryptedVault}
activate Server

Server -> Database: UPDATE users SET encryptedVault = ? WHERE username = ?
activate Database
Database --> Server: OK
deactivate Database

Server --> Browser: 200 OK
deactivate Server

Browser --> User: "Пароль сохранен"
deactivate Browser
@enduml